Guillermo del Toro's Pinocchio is a animation, fantasy,
adventure film directed by Mark Gustafson.

3
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:36,000
During the rise of fascism in Mussolini's Italy, a wooden boy brought
magically to life struggles to live up to his father's expectations.

4
